## 🚀 How to Run This Project

```bash
# 1. Install dependencies
npm install

# 2. Health check — verify everything is installed
npm run dev

# 3. Explore raw data (optional — for understanding the Excel structure)
npx tsx src/parsers/partyMasterParser.ts
npx tsx src/parsers/outstandingParser.ts

# 4. Run the main pipeline — ingests data and builds the database
npx tsx src/ingest.ts

# 5. Query a business from the database
npx tsx src/view.ts "Krishna"
npx tsx src/view.ts "Pharma"
```

